# Redirects for the static assets, read by Cloudflare Workers at deploy time.
# The file itself is never served.
#
# Crawlers and browsers ask for these conventional paths whether or not a page
# links to them. The real files keep the names Astro and `pnpm brand` give them.

/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-index.xml  301
/favicon.ico  /brand/sotto-icon.png  301
